Elara Vance is a name tied to [[Org/Pyrelight/index|Pyrelight]]. She appears both as a known member of the gang and in the corporate filings of companies associated with Pyrelight outside [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Teller's Run/index|Teller's Run]], and hers is the name attached to the gang's outside communication. [[Org/Belvedere/index|Belvedere]] counts her among the names that stand out around Pyrelight's rise.

She attended the opera at the same times as [[People/Camden Levine|Camden Levine]] over several weeks. She is billed as the Antenna in *[[Geography/Black and White/Soundscape Theaters|Song on Fire]]*, the film at the [[Geography/Black and White/Soundscape Theaters|Soundscape Theaters]], where the Spark is credited to Helena Ashcroft and the Kindling to [[Org/Roundhat Gang/People/Tywelwyn Leatherhide|Tywelwyn Leatherhide]].
